      "content": "that makes sense. what about edge cases where someone might try to perform a \"malicious\" deletion, like requesting their data be wiped just to cover up some fraudulent activity they were doing on the platform before they leave? how do we distinguish between a legitimate request and someone just trying to \"hide their tracks\"?",
